;; Ported from OCaml 5.5.0 (the release tarball, SHA-256 fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba):
;; stdlib/camlinternalFormat.ml's format parser (fmt_ebb_of_string in its legacy behaviour, fmtty_of_fmt,
;; concat_fmtty, the char sets) and typing/typecore.ml's type_format (the format as a Parsetree of
;; CamlinternalFormatBasics' constructors), whose notices follow (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
;;                          Benoit Vaugon, ENSTA
;;
;;   Copyright 2014 Institut National de Recherche en Informatique et
;;     en Automatique.
